{"mode":"words","text":"Kui õpid sõnavara nimekirju, ei õpi sa keelt. Sellel lehel näed reaalajas, kuidas see mõne sekundi jooksul teistmoodi tundub: Ülaltoodud näidistekst on tõeline rakenduse vaade, mida saad ise katsetada, ja seda selgitust loeb sulle kohe emakeele tasemel hääl ette, samal ajal kui sõnad valgustuvad. LinguaFlow abil õpid keeli nii, nagu su aju seda eelistab: kõigepealt mõistad, siis kuulad, seejärel räägid. Selle taga olev meetod on inspireeritud Birkenbihli meetodist ja koosneb neljast etapist: dekodeerimine, aktiivne kuulamine, passiivne kuulamine ja harjutamine. Proovi seda – puuduta ülevalt mõnda sõna.","words":[{"s":0,"e":80},{"s":240,"e":400},{"s":440,"e":880},{"s":920,"e":1600},{"s":1733,"e":2000},{"s":2159,"e":2220},{"s":2240,"e":2347},{"s":2400,"e":2880},{"s":2960,"e":4320},{"s":4347,"e":4560},{"s":4613,"e":4800},{"s":4853,"e":5840},{"s":5880,"e":6160},{"s":6180,"e":6240},{"s":6280,"e":6480},{"s":6560,"e":6960},{"s":7000,"e":7280},{"s":7333,"e":7920},{"s":7960,"e":8480},{"s":8853,"e":10080},{"s":10133,"e":10880},{"s":10960,"e":11120},{"s":11160,"e":11600},{"s":11640,"e":12080},{"s":12133,"e":12800},{"s":12840,"e":13040},{"s":13067,"e":13200},{"s":13260,"e":13440},{"s":13480,"e":14240},{"s":14427,"e":14800},{"s":14860,"e":15160},{"s":15190,"e":15680},{"s":15707,"e":15920},{"s":15960,"e":16160},{"s":16213,"e":16480},{"s":16533,"e":17040},{"s":17100,"e":17520},{"s":17573,"e":17760},{"s":17867,"e":18320},{"s":18480,"e":19120},{"s":19147,"e":19360},{"s":19480,"e":19680},{"s":19720,"e":20000},{"s":20040,"e":20800},{"s":21056,"e":22480},{"s":22533,"e":22720},{"s":22880,"e":23040},{"s":23093,"e":23360},{"s":23400,"e":23760},{"s":23880,"e":24320},{"s":24347,"e":24400},{"s":24440,"e":24640},{"s":24680,"e":24880},{"s":24920,"e":25600},{"s":25920,"e":26640},{"s":26680,"e":27680},{"s":27733,"e":28000},{"s":28053,"e":29200},{"s":29260,"e":29680},{"s":29760,"e":30320},{"s":30840,"e":31520},{"s":31580,"e":31840},{"s":31880,"e":32000},{"s":32080,"e":3256